# (HELMS forge-fix i2) begin (forge fix 2, the owner: "crown helms look alike at 1x; make the variants bolder"): `when
# helmfam-crown,<mass>` replace views, one bold outline per body-mass class (the first replacing view that holds wins).
# the sun crown: seven rays fanning out of a jewelled band (none, mantle and tall; the others keep the round helm and its points).
# Written by the HELMS area tools/d2.py (D R drawn; U is D with the face details dropped; L is R mirrored and re-lit).
# the sun crown (none, mantle, tall)
view D key rest origin 2 1 when helmfam-crown,variant-1 replace
mark crown 9 0
